Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(312,390)}這個總集篇由於製作的原因
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(350,415)}和正篇相比存在着一定的畫質不足
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(900,800)\pos(262,440)}在此預先請您原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.30,0:00:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.10,0:00:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.50,0:00:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
