Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.50,0:01:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.00,0:02:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.40,0:02:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 現在就去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人只要活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.70,0:02:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總會對那麼一兩個人有“要是沒這傢伙就好了”的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.30,0:02:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是世上有社會和秩序啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每個人恰如其分地保持自己心裏的平衡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好活下去的人佔大多數
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能保持平衡就好了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.30,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中也有被逼得走投無路的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺凌 嫉妒 背叛 自私
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.80,0:03:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些被作爲感情和慾望宣泄對象的人簡直慘不忍睹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.30,0:03:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用說  處於弱勢的人更是如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.80,0:03:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們就是一路看着這樣的人過來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下借你的全還清了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.30,0:03:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前還的只是利息哦 利息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼怨言麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果沒有我借給你的話會怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果討厭的話就告訴大家好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說我保管的錢弄丟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有點口渴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去買果汁來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我聽到一個奇怪的傳言啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說你夜晚在外面遊蕩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我覺得肯定是毫無根據的傳言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被抓住把柄的話就會讓人有機可乘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.70,0:04:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼一來 人就變得不可信了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.60,0:04:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 你的臉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近你好奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然我不願意這麼想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道最近家裏不見的錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽是相信你的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.70,0:04:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教練
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是刑警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你將他從堤壩上推了下去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.40,0:05:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過呢 從驗屍結果看如果不用棒狀物體毆打的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該不會造成這樣的傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺人犯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.90,0:05:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把伸一還給我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 冷靜點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室…室井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒…沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.70,0:05:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.00,0:05:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們倆是一箇中學的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道室井家的對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幫我送他回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你們應該知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你們兩個鬧着玩從堤壩上摔下來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這算什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 巖下 我求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 他就拜託你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}我該怎麼做好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知不覺中落入了陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.30,0:06:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}總之 求你們了 請相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.80,0:06:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發現時事情已經一發不可收拾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}迷路的 迷路的 小貓咪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用自己的地位及立場
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出無賴行徑的人也是有的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位刑警嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在掌握確鑿的證據之前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就請您再稍微忍耐一陣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.10,0:06:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如月先生 我女兒已經忍到極限了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs30\pos(550,160)\frz6}愛你啊\N\N涼子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.80,0:06:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再這樣下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.40,0:06:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鷹村先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.60,0:06:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,濫用職權的跟蹤狂警官
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.40,0:06:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思來晚了 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.60,0:07:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刑警先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遺憾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 拜託你不要死啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要丟下我一個人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.30,0:07:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實在那個時候議員河合先生打電話來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高爾夫嗎 我是沒問題啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.50,0:07:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一起去的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是給河合先生添麻煩嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}是 月底的星期二吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}我正好有空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根據客人的地位安排工作時間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.30,0:07:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜金主義 道德敗壞的獸醫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(432,442)}不不 完全沒問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那Candy不是沒有接受任何診治嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電話掛斷後雖然進行了治療
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.80,0:07:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那時已經太晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.40,0:07:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.40,0:08:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我沒有帶你去看那種醫生就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所發現的屍體是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小林徹 33歲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,經營電腦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.50,0:08:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目標是小林徹 33歲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什麼方法就看你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儘快幹掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下總算
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總算怎樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下總算能讓警察逮捕我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追究其他罪行的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.30,0:08:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺死你父親的證據也會出現
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的行動全被看穿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有 有人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警衛剛纔已被這傢伙收拾掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.80,0:08:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人的性命難道不值一提嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是殺一個和殺幾個都一樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是這樣把公司搞大的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你絕對會下地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是幾十年後的事了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生說到底就是場遊戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遊戲結束前享樂的人就是贏家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自我中心的女社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 安田太太 早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.50,0:09:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您家的女兒被編到我家女兒那個班了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們之間如果也能和睦相處就好了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.60,0:09:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲宣泄搞外遇被當場看到的憤怒 對人百般刁難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司宿舍的貴婦 分公司經理夫人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.60,0:09:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 振作點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼 爲什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.50,0:10:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了 住在這裏要是惹惱了那個人就算完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.20,0:10:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我會這麼倒黴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是戶高她自己不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.00,0:10:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戶高太太？ 到底發生了什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個是弘美小姐做的麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請嚐嚐看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有恩將仇報的當紅糕點師啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.70,0:10:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 森崎先生那裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.80,0:10:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 要是把姐姐的蛋糕帶去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.70,0:10:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就幫忙在街角蛋糕節目中宣傳咱們的店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.20,0:10:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個節目很受歡迎的 正好能做宣傳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.20,0:10:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天首先由請森崎先生來介紹他的新作蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個蛋糕叫什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的名字是“微醉”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18\fad(300,300)}Ivresse      法語【微醉】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏面用了神祕的材料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼就照例叫出伊藤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊藤小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.00,0:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.60,0:11:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 請她們馬上介紹一下點心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.00,0:11:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是我店的主打蛋糕“遺產”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18\fad(300,300)}Héritage    法語【遺產】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.20,0:11:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個店吧 最近剽竊森崎的蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.90,0:11:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說是原來的徒弟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.20,0:11:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快會倒閉的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 估計是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.20,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只是個傳言吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法求助於法律
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.20,0:12:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弱者們就懷着抓住救命稻草的心思 向小姐求救
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向地獄少女求救
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.10,0:12:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呼喚我來的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請幫我消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.70,0:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.30,0:13:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.10,0:13:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.50,0:13:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.80,0:13:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.40,0:13:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到這就必須做出極端的選擇了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是當然啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是這麼容易就讓人一個個地消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上的人不用多久就全消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管如何選擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.40,0:14:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是否締結契約必須由自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開這根紅線的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨就能消除了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.10,0:14:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辦不到 辦不到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原諒我吧 Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy那麼痛苦地死去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,橋本
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.90,0:14:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你談談麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在剛纔 學校收到了郵件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要辯解了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.10,0:15:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏面的人的確是你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.60,0:15:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不覺得羞恥嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作爲中學生竟然做成這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.00,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還很相信你 可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 希望請你的父母明天來一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.60,0:15:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去明年的高中保送也會變得很困難吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我還要感謝你和室井呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.80,0:15:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多虧你們 可以不用參加大賽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.70,0:15:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部員們可能想要留些青春的回憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過爲了這個就要耗損我的肩膀就有點…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帳 難道說是故意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意的話 你又想怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.60,0:15:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經夠了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.00,0:16:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井他 室井他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦地 痛苦地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.90,0:16:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.50,0:16:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我又沒有看見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊 爲什麼 爲什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果沒有你的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.20,0:16:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不會有這麼痛苦的回憶了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼痛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的愛讓你哪裏痛苦了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.90,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,涼子 我在問你痛苦什麼了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.70,0:16:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正只是這附近撿來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.40,0:16:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種狗跑來只會把醫院弄髒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄的臭氣熏天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是什麼地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.20,0:16:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種狗 爲了醫院也應該早點死比較好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這全是戶高太太她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 不要再說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.70,0:16:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼不能相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 根本連聽都不聽我說嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.70,0:17:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直 一直你只顧着自己的工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厚顏無恥地親近姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.90,0:17:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拒絕了就做出這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太差勁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被甩掉是當然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼都隨便你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在店也回不來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.80,0:17:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我很感謝你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.50,0:17:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲你給了我絕好的復仇機會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過沒想到會那麼順利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.60,0:17:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒這麼痛快了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就拼命工作還債吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.20,0:17:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然說早點死比較好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒 不能原諒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個世界纔是地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要那個人還活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個女人的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.40,0:18:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,涼子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.10,0:19:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠 花笠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.80,0:19:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺人兇手 殺人兇手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弘美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我也對您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.30,0:19:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 嚐嚐我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.70,0:19:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚐嚐我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要做這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.10,0:19:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞外遇的原來是戶高啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這隻發情的母狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下子丟臉丟大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們到底是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.60,0:19:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨頭斷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.10,0:19:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.00,0:19:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢讓我女兒如此痛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這種地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄的入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是說過輪到你了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是稍微會打點的程度而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.90,0:20:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是被稱爲十年難得一見的奇才啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不能打棒球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日本 不 是對世界職業棒球界來說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會給帶來多大的損失你不知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.60,0:20:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的腿受傷了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.50,0:20:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對自己的所作所爲有所悔悟了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒有什麼錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有錯的是涼子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.20,0:20:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背叛的一方纔有錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都是她的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.30,0:20:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是認真地喜歡她的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我一直這麼多關照她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她辜負了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.80,0:20:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.30,0:20:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是戲弄了她一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬧着玩的 鬧着玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.30,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒做什麼壞事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她這麼說哦 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.10,0:21:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢 慢着 想要把我帶到哪裏去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.80,0:21:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏到底是什麼地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.10,0:21:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道呢 到底是哪裏呢 親愛的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要幹什麼 放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.80,0:21:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要過來 不要過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消除了怨恨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就迎來了平靜的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像什麼都沒發生過一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.50,0:22:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不管之後是多麼幸福的人生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.30,0:22:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這世上盡頭等待着的卻是無盡的地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.50,0:22:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,銘記下的刻印
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.00,0:22:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你想忘也忘不掉的那份見證
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了也是地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:42.20,0:22:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着也是地獄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.80,0:22:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以後也會有很多人登錄地獄通信吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要還有胸懷怨恨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:58.70,0:23:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我們只遵從小姐的意識行動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
